msgid "You need a distinct website and account-page appearance"
msgstr "需要独立的网站设计和账号页外观"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Source fork"
msgstr "源码分支"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Your changes to application source and their ongoing integration"
msgstr "对应用源码的修改，以及持续与上游合并适配"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "The upstream source you choose to merge"
msgstr "你选择合并的上游源码"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Your requirements exceed the published configuration and module interfaces"
