#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:20
msgid ""
"The standard application is a default implementation, not a hosted service. Authentication, "
"persistence, email, model providers and optional services still need their documented deployment "
"configuration. The [Router Tutorial](router-tutorial.md) runs a local example from inference "
"through the Web/Admin Console."
msgstr ""
"标准应用是默认实现，并非托管服务。认证、持久化、邮件、模型提供商及可选服务仍需按照各自文档完成部署配置。[路由器教程](router-tutorial.md)提供了从推理到 "
"Web／管理控制台的本地运行示例。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:26
msgid "What a distribution can change"
msgstr "发行版可以定制什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:28
msgid ""
"“Runtime configuration” below means configuration read by the running services; it does not mean "
"every file is watched or that an open browser updates live. See [When changes take effect](#when-"
"changes-take-effect)."
msgstr ""
"下文中的“运行时配置”是指由运行中的服务读取的配置，并不表示每个文件都有变更监听，也不表示已打开的浏览器页面会实时更新。请参阅[变更何时生效](#when-changes-take-"
"effect)。"

