#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Upstream owns documented hooks; the distribution maintains its extension code"
msgstr "上游维护文档中定义的钩子；发行版维护其扩展代码"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:45
msgid ""
"The five account routes are `/login`, `/signup`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password` and "
"`/verify-email`. Their required fields, validation, submission, verification, session handling, "
"redirects and permission checks remain in the shared application. Changing their appearance does "
"not add a new login method or change account approval policy."
msgstr ""
"五个账号路由是 `/login`、`/signup`、`/forgot-password`、`/reset-password` 和 `/verify-"
"email`。它们的必填字段、表单校验、提交、身份验证、会话处理、重定向和权限检查仍由共享应用负责。改变页面外观不会增加新的登录方式，也不会改变账号审批策略。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:51
msgid ""
"There is no configuration field for an arbitrary home-page hero and no public interface for "
"replacing the console's overall theme, sidebar or layout. A module's CSS must be scoped to its "
"own pages; global selectors that restyle the console are outside the supported customization "
"boundary."
msgstr "目前没有用于任意首页主视觉区域的配置字段，也没有替换控制台整体主题、侧边栏或布局的公开接口。模块 CSS 必须限定在自身页面内；使用全局选择器改变控制台样式不在受支持的定制范围内。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:56
msgid ""
"A module can provide its own copy and override the message keys exposed by `authMessages`. "
"Unspecified keys use the shared defaults. The server `locale` sets the document language; it does"
" not translate the console. A localized home page therefore does not imply a fully localized "
"product."
msgstr ""
"模块可以提供自己的文案，并覆盖 `authMessages` 开放的消息键。未指定的键使用共享默认值。服务器端的 `locale` "
"用于设置文档语言，并不会翻译控制台。因此，首页本地化并不意味着整个产品都已本地化。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:61
msgid "Configuration is the first option"
msgstr "优先通过配置实现"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:63
msgid ""
"Start with the annotated `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` and "
"`config/examples/branding.example.yaml`. Keep deployment-owned files in your distribution "
"repository or overlay, with credentials in the environment."
msgstr ""
"从带注释的 `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` 和 `config/examples/branding.example.yaml` "
"开始。将部署自有文件保存在发行版仓库或覆盖层中，凭据放在环境变量里。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:67
msgid ""
"Set the site's name in `distribution.display_name`, and its URL and support address under `site`."
" Copy the complete branding template and point `site.branding` at it; a display name alone, "
"without a branding document, does not replace the frontend's default name."
msgstr ""
"在 `distribution.display_name` 中设置站点名称，在 `site` 下设置 URL 和支持邮箱地址。复制完整的品牌模板，并通过 `site.branding` "
"指向它；如果没有品牌文档，仅设置显示名称不会替换前端的默认名称。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:71
msgid ""
"Set `organization`, `links`, `example`, `assets`, `team`, `sponsors` and `data_policy_notice` in "
"the branding document as required. These are content inputs to the default components, not "
"arbitrary layout instructions. Extra `links.nav` entries add HTTPS header links; they do not "
"replace navigation. Team entries appear on `/team`, and sponsor entries on the default home page."
msgstr ""
"根据需要在品牌文档中设置 `organization`、`links`、`example`、`assets`、`team`、`sponsors` 和 "
"`data_policy_notice`。这些是默认组件的内容输入，并非任意布局指令。额外的 `links.nav` 条目会添加 HTTPS 页头链接，不会替换导航。团队条目展示在 "
"`/team`，赞助商条目展示在默认首页。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:76
msgid ""
"Serve local branding images through the mounted site-assets directory and `/site-assets/*`, or "
"use permitted public asset URLs. Check the URLs over HTTP."
msgstr "通过挂载的 site-assets 目录和 `/site-assets/*` 提供本地品牌图片，或使用允许的公开资源 URL。通过 HTTP 检查这些 URL。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:78
msgid ""
"Select model/routing files through the documented resolver, and keep provider credentials in "
"environment variables referenced by the registry."
msgstr "按文档中的配置解析规则选择模型／路由文件，并将提供商凭据保存在注册表引用的环境变量中。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:80
msgid ""
"Set `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` and explicitly select `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` when ready"
" to apply the manifest. The default `dark` mode validates and compares it without activating its "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"设置 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`，准备应用清单时显式选择 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`。默认的 `dark` "
"模式只校验和比较清单，不启用其中的设置。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:84
msgid ""
"The active backend exposes the permitted public subset through `/site-config`; the frontend uses "
"it for identity and presentation. A failed or invalid response produces a configuration error "
"instead of silently rendering a working site with different defaults. See "
"[Deployment](deployment.md#what-a-change-actually-requires)."
msgstr ""
"启用清单后的后端通过 `/site-config` "
"提供允许公开的配置子集；前端用它设置站点标识和展示。如果响应失败或无效，页面会报配置错误，而不会悄悄使用另一套默认值显示看似正常的站点。请参阅[部署](deployment.md#what-a"
"-change-actually-requires)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:90
msgid "Some similarly named settings have different jobs:"
msgstr "一些名称相近的设置承担着不同职责："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Actual effect"
msgstr "实际效果"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`features.public_signup: false` in an active manifest"
msgstr "已启用清单中的 `features.public_signup: false`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Closes both public registration UI and API; runtime `signup_enabled=true` cannot override it"
msgstr "同时关闭公开注册 UI 和 API；运行时的 `signup_enabled=true` 无法覆盖它"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`features.public_signup: true` or unset/null"
msgstr "`features.public_signup: true` 或未设置／null"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Defers to the effective runtime/environment signup policy; it does not bypass verification or "
"approval"
msgstr "遵循实际生效的运行时／环境注册策略；不会绕过验证或审批"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`features.rag: false` in an active manifest"
msgstr "已启用清单中的 `features.rag: false`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Disables the configured RAG UI and backend access; enabling it still requires the RAG service's "
"configuration"
msgstr "禁用已配置的 RAG UI 和后端访问；启用时仍需完成 RAG 服务配置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`features.routers`"
msgstr "`features.routers`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Declared/public metadata; it does not select or restrict the model router. Use the model's "
"`router` and supported admin overrides"
msgstr "声明性／公开元数据；不会选择或限制模型路由器。请使用模型的 `router` 和受支持的管理覆盖设置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`AGENT_PUBLIC_URL`, or the internal agent service destinations"
msgstr "`AGENT_PUBLIC_URL` 或内部 agent 服务目标地址"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Configure the existing agent link/proxy integration; they do not install an agent service or make"
" `/agents` a Site UI slot"
msgstr "配置已有的 agent 链接／代理集成；不会安装 agent 服务，也不会将 `/agents` 变成 Site UI 扩展点"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`site.terms_document` / `site.privacy_document`"
msgstr "`site.terms_document` / `site.privacy_document`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Accepted manifest fields, but not a loader for the current terms page. Use the Site UI legal-page"
" interface to publish custom text"
msgstr "清单接受这些字段，但当前条款页不会据此加载文档。请使用 Site UI 法律条款页接口发布自定义文本"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:101
msgid ""
"For exact signup precedence, see [The distribution manifest](configuration.md#the-distribution-"
"manifest); for RAG, see [Docs RAG Assistant](rag-chat.md); for service paths, see [The public "
"path table](public-path-table.md). A public branding hint or hidden navigation item is not a "
"substitute for backend authorization."
msgstr ""
"注册策略的确切优先级见[发行版清单](configuration.md#the-distribution-manifest)；RAG 见[文档 RAG 助手](rag-"
"chat.md)；服务路径见[公开路径表](public-path-table.md)。公开的品牌提示或隐藏导航项不能替代后端授权。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:107
msgid ""
"Model/provider changes made through supported admin APIs take effect on the running gateway and "
"are persisted in its database. They do not rewrite the YAML; stored overrides are applied on top "
"of it again at startup. Account for both layers when investigating a configuration difference. "
"See [Runtime configuration](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)."
msgstr ""
"通过受支持的管理 API 修改模型／提供商，会在运行中的网关上生效，并持久化到其数据库。这些修改不会重写 YAML；启动时，已保存的覆盖设置会再次叠加到 YAML "
"之上。排查配置差异时，应同时检查这两层。请参阅[运行时配置](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:113
msgid ""
"Backend extensions are trusted Python code loaded at startup, not a general UI or authentication "
"plugin system. Use the documented adapter, setting, provider metadata, agent-access and quota "
"registration hooks; a new authentication flow or arbitrary business endpoint needs its own "
"implementation and review."
msgstr ""
"后端扩展是在启动时加载的可信 Python 代码，并非通用 UI 或认证插件系统。请使用文档中定义的适配器、设置、提供商元数据、agent "
"访问和配额注册钩子；新的认证流程或任意业务端点需要单独实现和评审。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:118
msgid "When changes take effect"
msgstr "变更何时生效"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Change"
msgstr "变更"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Required action"
msgstr "所需操作"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Frontend image rebuild?"
msgstr "是否需要重新构建前端镜像？"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Mounted distribution manifest, branding YAML, model/routing files"
msgstr "挂载的发行版清单、品牌 YAML、模型／路由文件"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Restart the backend to load the changed files; reload the page to check presentation"
msgstr "重启后端以加载修改后的文件；重新加载页面检查展示"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "A mounted site-assets file"
msgstr "挂载的 site-assets 文件"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Replace it in the overlay; verify the served URL (the response allows five minutes of browser "
"caching)"
msgstr "在覆盖层中替换文件；验证实际提供的 URL（响应允许浏览器缓存五分钟）"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Runtime environment, including server-only frontend destinations"
msgstr "运行时环境变量，包括仅供服务器端使用的前端目标地址"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Recreate the affected container with the new environment; a plain restart retains the old "
"container environment"
msgstr "使用新环境变量重新创建受影响的容器；仅重启会保留容器原有的环境变量"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "No, for runtime values"
msgstr "运行时值不需要"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Supported admin model/provider/routing/settings edit"
msgstr "受支持的模型／提供商／路由／设置管理修改"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Save through the admin console/API; check the effective value and any feature-specific caching"
msgstr "通过管理控制台／API 保存；检查实际生效值及该功能的缓存行为"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Site UI components, compiled copy, CSS or packaged assets"
msgstr "Site UI 组件、编译进镜像的文案、CSS 或打包资源"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Build and deploy a new frontend image containing that module"
msgstr "构建并部署包含该模块的新前端镜像"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"A true build-only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` value or the backend network target compiled from "
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`"
msgstr "真正仅在构建时生效的 `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` 值，或由 `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` 编译确定的后端网络目标地址"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Rebuild and deploy the frontend"
msgstr "重新构建并部署前端"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Source or extension code"
msgstr "源码或扩展代码"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Rebuild the affected image, or restart the backend for an already-mounted importable extension"
msgstr "重新构建受影响的镜像；对于已经挂载且可导入的扩展，重启后端即可"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Depends on where the code is packaged"
msgstr "取决于代码的打包位置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:130
msgid ""
"Changing `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` itself requires recreating the frontend container. Reusing a standard "
"frontend image also assumes its compiled backend network target matches your deployment; that "
"target is separate from site branding. Use runtime branding for identity rather than introducing "
"new build-time branding variables. The precise Compose commands are in "
"[Deployment](deployment.md#what-a-change-actually-requires)."
msgstr ""
"修改 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` "
"本身需要重新创建前端容器。复用标准前端镜像的前提还包括：其编译时确定的后端网络目标地址与你的部署一致；这个目标地址与站点品牌无关。请使用运行时品牌配置设置站点标识，避免引入新的构建时品牌变量。具体"
" Compose 命令见[部署](deployment.md#what-a-change-actually-requires)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:137
msgid "Three implementation paths"
msgstr "三条实施路径"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:139
msgid "1. Keep the standard UI and configure a distribution"
msgstr "1\\. 保留标准 UI，配置自己的发行版"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:141
msgid ""
"Start from the [example distribution](configuration.md#the-example-distribution) and its "
"tutorial. Replace the teaching provider, local-only credentials and service settings for your "
"environment."
msgstr "从[示例发行版](configuration.md#the-example-distribution)及其教程开始。根据你的环境替换教学用提供商、仅供本地使用的凭据和服务设置。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:144
msgid ""
"Create your manifest, branding YAML and model/routing configuration; mount the files and branding"
" assets in the appropriate services."
msgstr "创建清单、品牌 YAML 和模型／路由配置；将文件和品牌资源挂载到对应服务中。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:146
msgid ""
"Use the standard frontend image with no Site UI selection. Validate the manifest in dark mode, "
"activate it, then recreate/restart services as above."
msgstr "使用标准前端镜像，不选择 Site UI 模块。先在 dark 模式下校验清单，再启用清单，并按上文说明重新创建或重启服务。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:148
msgid ""
"Check `/site-config`, the home and account pages, branding URLs and the authenticated console. "
"Exercise registration policy and a model request."
msgstr "检查 `/site-config`、首页和账号页面、品牌 URL，以及登录后的控制台。验证注册策略并发起一次模型请求。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:151
msgid "This path needs no React implementation and keeps the upstream page layouts."
msgstr "这条路径无需编写 React 组件，并保留上游页面布局。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:153
msgid "2. Build distinct public pages with Site UI"
msgstr "2\\. 使用 Site UI 构建独立设计的公开页面"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:155
msgid ""
"Complete the configuration path first; a custom module still needs the backend's runtime "
"configuration and shared services."
msgstr "先完成配置路径；自定义模块仍需要后端运行时配置和共享服务。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:157
msgid ""
"Follow [Distribution-owned public pages](site-ui.md) to create an API v1 module with its "
"manifest, required client entry and stylesheet. Export only the page components you want to "
"replace; omitted components keep defaults."
msgstr "按照[发行版自有公开页面](site-ui.md)创建 API v1 模块，提供清单、必需的客户端入口和样式表。只导出需要替换的页面组件；未提供的组件继续使用默认实现。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:160
msgid ""
"Import shared capabilities only from `@site-ui/host`, alongside permitted framework and module-"
"local imports. Preserve shared form nodes, accessibility hooks, terms anchors and account "
"navigation."
msgstr "共享能力只能从 `@site-ui/host` 导入，此外可使用允许的框架导入和模块内部导入。保留共享表单节点、无障碍钩子、条款锚点和账号导航。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:163
msgid ""
"Build with the official frontend Dockerfile, the `site-ui` named context and `SITE_UI_API=1`. Pin"
" the upstream source and module source used for release."
msgstr "使用官方前端 Dockerfile、`site-ui` 命名上下文和 `SITE_UI_API=1` 构建。锁定发布所用的上游源码和模块源码版本。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:165
msgid ""
"Deploy the resulting frontend with the configured backend. Test every owned route, asset and form"
" state, and check the shared console for style leakage."
msgstr "将生成的前端与已配置的后端一起部署。测试模块负责的每个路由、资源和表单状态，并检查模块样式是否影响共享控制台。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:168
msgid ""
"The module is compiled into the same Next.js application; it is not fetched or swapped at "
"runtime. An absent module selects the standard UI. A selected module with missing required files,"
" a mismatched API version or unsupported imports fails the build. Module content changes require "
"a new image; runtime branding values read by the module retain their runtime behavior."
msgstr ""
"模块会被编译进同一个 Next.js 应用，不会在运行时获取或替换。未提供模块时使用标准 UI。已选择的模块如果缺少必需文件、API "
"版本不匹配或包含不受支持的导入，构建会失败。修改模块内容需要新镜像；模块读取的运行时品牌值仍按运行时配置的方式生效。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:174
msgid "3. Upgrade an existing source fork"
msgstr "3\\. 升级已有的源码分支"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:176
msgid ""
"Inventory local changes by route and behavior. Separate branding values, public-page "
"presentation, shared-console changes and backend logic."
msgstr "按路由和行为盘点本地修改，区分品牌值、公开页面展示、共享控制台修改和后端逻辑。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:178
msgid ""
"Where they fit, move values into runtime configuration and public-page presentation into a Site "
"UI module. Migration is optional; you can keep the fork, with its ongoing merge and verification "
"work. A UI module keeps authentication controllers shared."
msgstr "将适合的配置值迁入运行时配置，将适合的公开页面展示迁入 Site UI 模块。迁移是可选的；你可以保留源码分支，并继续承担合并和验证工作。UI 模块会继续共用认证控制器。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:182
msgid ""
"Identify remaining source changes explicitly. Console redesigns, extra routes and new "
"authentication behavior do not become supported module features merely by moving files into the "
"module directory."
msgstr "明确列出仍需保留的源码修改。重新设计控制台、增加路由或新增认证行为，不会仅因相关文件移入模块目录就成为受支持的模块功能。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:185
msgid ""
"Merge the intended upstream version in an isolated branch, resolve conflicts against your "
"required behavior, and build the exact frontend/backend pair."
msgstr "在独立分支中合并目标上游版本，按所需行为解决冲突，并构建待发布的确切前端／后端组合。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:187
msgid ""
"Verify the distribution in staging before promoting it. A successful merge or upstream CI result "
"alone does not verify a fork's presentation or flows."
msgstr "在推广发布前，先在 staging 环境验证发行版。仅合并成功或上游 CI 通过，并不能验证源码分支的展示和流程。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:190
msgid ""
"Adopting Site UI can reduce future conflicts; it does not automatically migrate an existing fork "
"or make arbitrary upstream source paths stable interfaces."
msgstr "采用 Site UI 可以减少今后的冲突，但不会自动迁移已有源码分支，也不会使任意上游源码路径成为稳定接口。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:193
msgid "Upgrade and compatibility checklist"
msgstr "升级与兼容性检查清单"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:195
msgid ""
"Upstream maintains the standard implementation, configuration consumers and published Site UI "
"contract. Within API v1, optional additions are compatible; removing exports, changing prop "
"meanings or repurposing semantic hooks requires an API revision and migration. The deprecated "
"`authAppearance` class map remains supported throughout v1. See [Compatibility](site-"
"ui.md#6-compatibility)."
msgstr ""
"上游维护标准实现、读取配置的代码和已公布的 Site UI 接口契约。在 API v1 内，新增可选能力属于兼容变更；删除导出项、改变属性含义或改变语义钩子的用途，需要修订 API "
"版本并提供迁移方式。已弃用的 `authAppearance` 类名映射在整个 v1 生命周期内持续受支持。请参阅[兼容性](site-ui.md#6-compatibility)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:201
msgid ""
"Each distribution maintains its configuration, module, deployment and any fork changes. Before "
"promotion:"
msgstr "各发行版维护自己的配置、模块、部署和源码分支修改。推广发布前："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:204
msgid ""
"Pin the upstream version and, for custom UI, the module version and produced image digest. Keep "
"the matching configuration and asset versions recoverable."
msgstr "锁定上游版本；对于自定义 UI，还应锁定模块版本和生成的镜像摘要。确保可以恢复与之匹配的配置和资源版本。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:206
msgid ""
"Read configuration/API migration notes and validate against the selected version. Unsupported "
"module API revisions must stop the build."
msgstr "阅读配置／API 迁移说明，并针对所选版本进行校验。不受支持的模块 API 版本必须使构建终止。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:208
msgid ""
"Inspect the actual image's `/app/site-ui-manifest.json` to confirm the intended standard or "
"custom build; test packaged and mounted assets over HTTP."
msgstr "检查实际镜像中的 `/app/site-ui-manifest.json`，确认构建结果使用的是预期的标准 UI 或自定义 UI；通过 HTTP 测试打包资源和挂载资源。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:210
msgid ""
"Check public routes, configured links, narrow/wide layouts, keyboard access, form "
"validation/loading/errors, login/logout and the registration policy."
msgstr "检查公开路由、配置的链接、窄屏／宽屏布局、键盘操作、表单校验／加载／错误状态、登录／退出和注册策略。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:212
msgid ""
"Check the authenticated console, user/admin permissions and an inference request against the "
"deployed candidate, including any local fork behavior."
msgstr "针对已部署的候选版本检查登录后的控制台、用户／管理员权限，并发起一次推理请求，同时覆盖本地源码分支的行为。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:214
msgid ""
"Promote only the tested image/configuration combination and retain the prior combination for "
"rollback. Upstream merging a change does not itself define when a distribution upgrades; that is "
"its release pipeline's responsibility."
msgstr "只推广经过验证的镜像与配置组合，并保留上一组以便回滚。上游合并变更本身不会决定发行版何时升级；升级时机由发行版的发布流水线负责。"
